every batch visits every arm exactly once: true
every pair of arms is visited in both orders equally often, at every even batch count: true
position histograms are equal at every multiple of the exact batch count: true
and at no batch count below the first multiple: true
an even arm count: no arm visits a position class twice below the arm count's batches: true
the advanced-by-one rotation balances no histogram the spread design leaves unbalanced: true
nor gives any arm more edge visits than the advanced-by-one rotation's worst arm: true
and an arm count where the spread design is exact at half the batches: true

The gh-ocannl-743 case, 20 arms:
   8 batches: spread: histograms equal false, edge visits 0-2, most visits to one class 2
              advanced-by-one: histograms equal false, edge visits 0-4, most visits to one class 4
  20 batches: spread: histograms equal true, edge visits 2-2, most visits to one class 2
              advanced-by-one: histograms equal false, edge visits 0-4, most visits to one class 4
  40 batches: spread: histograms equal true, edge visits 4-4, most visits to one class 4
              advanced-by-one: histograms equal true, edge visits 4-4, most visits to one class 4

visiting order: spread mirrored rotation, 20 arm(s) x 8 batches -- every pair exchanged: true; position histograms equal: false (exact at multiples of 20 batches); edge visits per arm 0-2
visiting order: spread mirrored rotation, 3 arm(s) x 6 batches -- every pair exchanged: true; position histograms equal: true (exact at multiples of 6 batches); edge visits per arm 4-4
an odd batch count is refused: true
a zero batch count is refused: true
no arms is refused: true

